Package: climniche
Type: Package
Title: Niche Relative Climate Exposure
Version: 0.3.7
Date: 2026-07-26
Authors@R: c(
    person("Bohao", "He", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "bohao.he@polimi.it")
    )
Description: Quantifies projected climatic change relative to a species'
    current realised climatic niche. A fitted climatic metric gives local
    current-to-future displacement, signed change in distance from the current
    reference centre, a derived non-radial reconfiguration term, and future
    exceedance beyond an empirical weighted radial boundary. Occurrence
    records, range maps, and binary or continuous species distribution model
    outputs can define reference weights. Matrix, raster, terra and temporal
    workflows provide cell-level results, weighted summaries, maps and
    variable-level attribution of squared niche distance change.
